   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5b44cac50a894e589871012b",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Peter Winckles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5b44cac50a894e589871012b",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>It's interesting that the ghost nodes aren't being rolled back when the transaction fails. This sounds like two bugs:</p>\n\n<p>1. PUTs to fcr:metadata should be rejected if it does not already exist (fcr:metadata resources should only be created as a side-effect of creating a non-RDF resource)<br/>\n2. Ghost nodes are not rolled back if the transaction that created them fails.</p>",
     "created": "18/Feb/21 6:29 PM",
     "id": "22078",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/13592/comment/22078",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "5b44cac50a894e589871012b",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Peter Winckles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5b44cac50a894e589871012b",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "18/Feb/21 6:29 PM"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Ben Pennell",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Doing a PUT to a fcr:metadata is a legit method of updating the user RDF in the binary's description, as long as it is the child of a non-rdf resource.</p>",
     "created": "19/Feb/21 9:42 AM",
     "id": "22082",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/13592/comment/22082",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Ben Pennell",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "19/Feb/21 9:42 AM"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5b44cac50a894e589871012b",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21c1d174519bf2720dc4edf000a76668?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FPW-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Peter Winckles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5b44cac50a894e589871012b",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Yes, it's valid for <em>updating</em>. So, if there is a PUT on a fcr:metadata resource that does not exist, it should be rejected.</p>",
     "created": "19/Feb/21 9:50 AM",
     "id": "22084",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/13592/comment/22084",
     "updateAuthor": {
