  "description": "<p>Making a PUT request to a fcr:metadata endpoint for an object that doesn't exist returns a 500 error and logs a lengthy stacktrace, and actually leaves behind ghost nodes for the intermediate container. It seems like the fcr:metadata path should be rejected before anything is created, and give a 4xx response.</p>\n\n<p>In this example, \"what\" does not exist:</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPUT http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/what/fcr:metadata -v\r\n</span>\r\nHTTP/1.1 500 Internal Server Error\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>It logs the following:</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\nWARN 16:05:35.303 (WildcardExceptionMapper) Unmapped exception\r\norg.fcrepo.storage.ocfl.exception.ValidationException: Resource info:fedora/what/fcr:metadata is not a valid Fedora 6 resource. The following problems were identified:\r\n  1. Must define property <span class=\"code-quote\">'objectRoot'</span> as <span class=\"code-quote\">'<span class=\"code-keyword\">true</span>'</span> but was <span class=\"code-quote\">'<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>'</span>\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.storage.ocfl.exception.ValidationException.createForResource(ValidationException.java:51)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.storage.ocfl.DefaultOcflObjectSession.validateHeaders(DefaultOcflObjectSession.java:628)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.storage.ocfl.DefaultOcflObjectSession.writeHeaders(DefaultOcflObjectSession.java:605)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.storage.ocfl.DefaultOcflObjectSession.writeResource(DefaultOcflObjectSession.java:204)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.FcrepoOcflObjectSessionWrapper.lambda$writeResource$0(FcrepoOcflObjectSessionWrapper.java:81)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.FcrepoOcflObjectSessionWrapper.exec(FcrepoOcflObjectSessionWrapper.java:202)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.FcrepoOcflObjectSessionWrapper.lambda$writeResource$1(FcrepoOcflObjectSessionWrapper.java:81)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.common.metrics.MetricsHelper.time(MetricsHelper.java:45)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.FcrepoOcflObjectSessionWrapper.writeResource(FcrepoOcflObjectSessionWrapper.java:80)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.AbstractRdfSourcePersister.writeRdf(AbstractRdfSourcePersister.java:146)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.AbstractRdfSourcePersister.persistRDF(AbstractRdfSourcePersister.java:81)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.CreateRdfSourcePersister.persist(CreateRdfSourcePersister.java:77)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.OcflPersistentStorageSession.persist(OcflPersistentStorageSession.java:187)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.OcflPersistentStorageSessionMetrics.lambda$persist$0(OcflPersistentStorageSessionMetrics.java:68)\r\n\tat io.micrometer.core.instrument.composite.CompositeTimer.record(CompositeTimer.java:79)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.persistence.ocfl.impl.OcflPersistentStorageSessionMetrics.persist(OcflPersistentStorageSessionMetrics.java:67)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.kernel.impl.services.CreateResourceServiceImpl.perform(CreateResourceServiceImpl.java:201)\r\n\tat org.fcrepo.http.api.FedoraLdp.createOrReplaceObjectRdf(FedoraLdp.java:474)\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>Also worth noting, if the container exists before making the request, it produces the following somewhat confusing response:</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPUT http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/new_c\r\n</span>\r\ncurl -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -XPUT http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/new_c/fcr:metadata -v\r\n</span># HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found\r\n# Error: No OCFL mapping found <span class=\"code-keyword\">for</span> info:fedora/new_c/fcr:metadata\r\n\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
